info: on gcp: Cloud Run runs services with less than 1 vCPU one request at a time; more_memory uses 1 vCPU
  --> sizes.clowd:10:3
   |
10 |   cpu 0.25
   |   ^^^^^^^^

info: on gcp: Cloud Run needs 6 vCPU for 20gb; big uses 6 vCPU
  --> sizes.clowd:28:3
   |
28 |   memory 20gb
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^

